{"v":1,"book":"Hos","ch":6,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Come and let us return to Jehovah; For He has torn us, but He will heal us, And He has stricken us, but He will bind us up.","tok":[{"t":"Come","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" and let us "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; For He has "},{"t":"torn","s":["H2963"],"a":[6]},{"t":" us, but He will "},{"t":"heal","s":["H7495"],"a":[7]},{"t":" us, And He has stricken us, but He will bind us "},{"t":"up","s":["H2280"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"He will enliven us after two days; On the third day He will raise us up, And we will live in His presence.","tok":[{"t":"He will enliven us after two "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; On the "},{"t":"third","s":["H7992"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[2]},{"t":" He will raise us "},{"t":"up","s":["H6965"],"a":[4]},{"t":", And we will "},{"t":"live","s":["H2421"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in His presence."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Therefore let us know, let us pursue knowing Jehovah: His going forth is as sure as the dawn, And He will come to us as the rain, As the late rain which waters the earth.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore let us "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[0]},{"t":", let us pursue "},{"t":"knowing","s":["H3045"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":": His going "},{"t":"forth","s":["H4161"],"a":[7]},{"t":" is as sure as the dawn, And He will "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to us as the "},{"t":"rain","s":["H1653"],"a":[9]},{"t":", As the "},{"t":"late","s":["H4456"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rain","s":["H3384"],"a":[12]},{"t":" which waters the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"What shall I do with you, O Ephraim? What shall I do with you, O Judah? For your lovingkindness is like a morning cloud And like dew that departs early.","tok":[{"t":"What shall I "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[1]},{"t":" with you, O "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[3]},{"t":"? What shall I "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":" with you, O "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[7]},{"t":"? For your lovingkindness is like a "},{"t":"morning","s":["H1242"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cloud","s":["H6051"],"a":[9]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"like","s":["H7925"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dew","s":["H2919"],"a":[11]},{"t":" that departs "},{"t":"early","s":["H7925"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Therefore I hewed them to pieces by the prophets; I slew them by the words of My mouth, And My judgments went forth as light.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore I "},{"t":"hewed","s":["H2672"],"a":[2]},{"t":" them to pieces by the "},{"t":"prophets","s":["H5030"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; I slew them by the "},{"t":"words","s":["H0561"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of My "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[6]},{"t":", And My "},{"t":"judgments","s":["H4941"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"went","s":["H0216"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3318"],"a":[9]},{"t":" as "},{"t":"light","s":["H0216"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"For I delight in lovingkindness and not sacrifice, And the knowledge of God more than burnt offerings.","tok":[{"t":"For I delight in lovingkindness and not "},{"t":"sacrifice","s":["H2077"],"a":[4]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[6]},{"t":" more than burnt "},{"t":"offerings","s":["H5930"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"But they like Adam have transgressed the covenant; There they have acted treacherously against Me.","tok":[{"t":"But they like Adam have "},{"t":"transgressed","s":["H5674"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"covenant","s":["H1285"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; There they have acted "},{"t":"treacherously","s":["H0898"],"a":[5]},{"t":" against Me."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Gilead is a city of those who commit iniquity; It is tracked with blood.","tok":[{"t":"Gilead","s":["H1568"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is a "},{"t":"city","s":["H7151"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of those who commit "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H0205"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; It is "},{"t":"tracked","s":["H6121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"And like bands of robbers lying in wait for a man, The company of priests murder on the way to Shechem; Indeed they commit wickedness.","tok":[{"t":"And like bands of robbers lying in "},{"t":"wait","s":["H2442"],"a":[0]},{"t":" for a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[1]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"company","s":["H2267"]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"priests","s":["H3548"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"murder","s":["H7523"],"a":[6]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to Shechem; Indeed they "},{"t":"commit","s":["H6213"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wickedness","s":["H2154"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"In the house of Israel I have seen a horrid thing: The harlotry of Ephraim is there; Israel has defiled itself.","tok":[{"t":"In the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[1]},{"t":" I have "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[2]},{"t":" a horrid "},{"t":"thing","s":["H8186"],"a":[3]},{"t":": The harlotry of "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[6]},{"t":" is there; "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[8]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"defiled","s":["H2930"],"a":[7]},{"t":" itself."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Also, O Judah, there is a harvest appointed for you, When I will turn the captivity of My people.","tok":[{"t":"Also, O "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"there","s":["H7896"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is a "},{"t":"harvest","s":["H7105"],"a":[3]},{"t":" appointed for you, When I will turn the "},{"t":"captivity","s":["H7622"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of My "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]}]}
